      "seed": 111107211,
      "version": 343,
      "versionNonce": 1389958667,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784746521702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP TWO\n\nBack of the envelope estimation\n\nRequest Per Second\n- Assume we have 10million short url generated per month \n- Assume the read:write is 100:1\n- WPS = 10000000/30*24*3600 = approximately 4 WPS\n- RPS = 100 * 4 = 400 RPS\n\n\nStorage Requirements\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STEP TWO\n\nBack of the envelope estimation\n\nRequest Per Second\n- Assume we have 10million short url generated per month \n- Assume the read:write is 100:1\n- WPS = 10000000/30*24*3600 = approximately 4 WPS\n- RPS = 100 * 4 = 400 RPS\n\n\nStorage Requirements\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
